141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (CapacityConnect is a peer-to-peer skill-sharing platform developed to bridge the gap between individuals who possess valuable skills and those who are looking to acquire new skills. In traditional learning environments, users often depend on formal courses, instructors, or scattered online resources, while many individuals have practical knowledge that remains underutilized. CapacityConnect provides a structured platform where users can showcase the skills they can offer, identify the skills they want to learn, discover suitable peers, and exchange knowledge. The system promotes two-way learning, allowing a user to be both a learner and a skill provider. By connecting people based on their skills and learning interests, CapacityConnect encourages collaboration, knowledge sharing, and continuous personal development. The proposed platform aims to make learning more accessible, interactive, community-driven, and mutually beneficial.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
